- `crates/argmin-s3/src/config.rs:583-612` - Shows runtime credentials and secret keys are environment-provided and the frontend listen address defaults to 127.0.0.1:9000.
- `crates/argmin-s3/src/main.rs:6185-6216` - Frontend binds a TCP listener at the configured S3 HTTP address.
